WEBVTT

01:31.740 --> 01:35.080
[NORTHWARD]

01:35.110 --> 01:36.140
[Episode 8]

01:47.009 --> 01:48.020
Are you home?

01:49.270 --> 01:50.870
Haihong, come in, come in.

01:50.870 --> 01:51.970
Have a seat. Sit.

01:52.110 --> 01:52.750
Come on.

01:52.789 --> 01:54.310
Sit, and I'll pour you some tea.

01:54.640 --> 01:55.670
Please don't fuss.

01:55.910 --> 01:56.840
Don't bother.

01:57.350 --> 01:58.830
I just drank a lot of water.

01:58.830 --> 02:00.270
Sit down. I have something to tell you.

02:00.310 --> 02:01.270
I'll leave right after.

02:02.030 --> 02:03.070
What is it?

02:04.470 --> 02:06.100
You know I have a middle school classmate who sells insurance, right?

02:07.270 --> 02:08.350
He just told me

02:08.350 --> 02:10.650
there's a free health check-up slot available.

02:10.710 --> 02:12.310
I've already had my check-up earlier this year,

02:12.310 --> 02:13.750
so I'm giving this slot to you.

02:13.790 --> 02:14.620
You should go.

02:14.620 --> 02:15.500
No need.

02:15.530 --> 02:17.020
I just saw a doctor of traditional Chinese medicine.

02:17.070 --> 02:17.829
I'm fine.

02:18.710 --> 02:20.520
Listen to me. Don't be lazy about it.

02:20.590 --> 02:22.990
Just half a day at the hospital, that's all.

02:23.070 --> 02:24.079
Really, it's not necessary.

02:24.190 --> 02:25.350
You can just give this spot

02:25.350 --> 02:26.630
to someone else.

02:26.630 --> 02:27.590
I don't need it.

02:28.390 --> 02:30.360
It's a free health check-up.

02:31.390 --> 02:33.740
Don't worry. It won't take half a day.

02:33.770 --> 02:34.970
It won't interfere with anything important.

02:37.420 --> 02:38.350
Take a look at it.

02:42.920 --> 02:44.980
Later, let Yuling take you to the hospital.

02:45.520 --> 02:46.320
She's familiar with it.

02:47.920 --> 02:48.800
Yuling!

02:51.730 --> 02:52.579
Everything...

02:52.600 --> 02:53.190
Okay.

02:53.190 --> 02:54.829
It's all in here. Take it.

02:54.960 --> 02:55.750
Okay.

02:56.900 --> 02:57.540
What about the vehicle?

02:58.110 --> 02:59.630
Go to Qian, who sells vegetables at the entrance,

02:59.670 --> 03:00.470
and borrow his small three-wheeler.

03:00.490 --> 03:01.050
It'll be quicker that way.

03:01.120 --> 03:01.920
Okay, okay, okay.

03:02.050 --> 03:03.050
Ride slowly.

03:03.090 --> 03:03.550
Be careful.

03:03.550 --> 03:04.770
Then we're heading over now.

03:05.550 --> 03:06.760
Granny Ma, don't rush.

03:06.830 --> 03:07.460
Get a thorough check-up.

03:07.460 --> 03:08.430
Okay.

03:08.500 --> 03:09.270
Don't worry.

03:17.300 --> 03:18.110
There's a cat over there.

03:21.600 --> 03:22.400
Here.

03:26.220 --> 03:31.050
[HZ Vision]

03:32.520 --> 03:33.350
Smile a bit wider for me.

03:33.390 --> 03:34.270
Show your teeth.

03:34.320 --> 03:35.640
Yes. Nice!

03:35.670 --> 03:36.180
Very nice!

03:36.180 --> 03:37.030
Give me a smile!

03:37.110 --> 03:37.910
Yes, like a star!

03:37.910 --> 03:38.790
Think of yourself as a star!

03:38.840 --> 03:40.440
One, two, three, go!

03:44.200 --> 03:44.960
Let's take another one.

03:46.220 --> 03:47.010
Beautiful.

03:47.620 --> 03:48.329
One more shot.

03:48.360 --> 03:49.130
Sprinkle.

03:49.640 --> 03:50.560
Behind that shirt.

03:51.079 --> 03:51.829
Yes, yes, yes.

03:51.850 --> 03:53.210
Come on, one, two, three.

03:53.829 --> 03:55.710
So modeling is that simple?

03:55.710 --> 03:57.110
The money seems way too easy to make.

03:57.110 --> 03:58.390
Keep your voice down.

04:01.230 --> 04:02.020
Move a little to the right.

04:02.050 --> 04:02.790
That's it.

04:02.820 --> 04:04.600
That's a digital camera.

04:04.630 --> 04:05.680
It costs tens of thousands of yuan.

04:06.120 --> 04:06.870
Abroad,

04:06.870 --> 04:09.070
only top photographers use this kind of camera.

04:11.240 --> 04:11.950
You're here.

04:13.230 --> 04:14.050
You see.

04:14.110 --> 04:15.470
I'm busy right now.

04:15.500 --> 04:16.820
I'll be done after taking a few more shots.

04:16.950 --> 04:19.060
You can wait for me at the café downstairs.

04:19.300 --> 04:20.589
Okay, you carry on then.

04:20.610 --> 04:21.390
Okay, okay, great.

04:21.430 --> 04:21.990
See you in a bit.

04:23.820 --> 04:24.520
Come on, come on.

04:24.550 --> 04:25.310
Let's take two more.

04:30.070 --> 04:31.620
Don't be nervous.

04:31.650 --> 04:33.450
You're making me nervous too.

04:33.970 --> 04:35.409
I'm not.

04:36.350 --> 04:38.310
Just now, when we were watching him take photos,

04:38.390 --> 04:39.980
you were so nervous that your hands were trembling.

04:40.810 --> 04:42.520
That was excitement.

04:44.550 --> 04:45.270
I was too.

04:45.950 --> 04:47.350
Just now that scene

04:47.670 --> 04:49.180
with the flashing lights going off

04:49.230 --> 04:50.680
made me feel like I was walking down the red carpet.

04:52.140 --> 04:54.470
Hello, friends over there!

04:55.270 --> 04:56.510
I love you all too!

04:58.730 --> 04:59.540
You're already getting into it?

05:00.540 --> 05:01.410
Hello, Hai.

05:02.030 --> 05:03.450
This is my classmate, Ma Siyi.

05:04.550 --> 05:05.350
Oh, your surname is Ma too?

05:05.990 --> 05:07.030
You have the same surname as my sister.

05:07.110 --> 05:08.310
What a coincidence.

05:08.580 --> 05:09.390
Please, sit down.

05:14.980 --> 05:16.260
Have you done any commercials before?

05:17.940 --> 05:18.700
No.

05:18.740 --> 05:20.030
It's the first time for both of us.

05:20.070 --> 05:20.860
We have no experience.

05:20.890 --> 05:22.550
Hai, please give us more guidance in the future.

05:22.590 --> 05:23.590
No problem, no problem.

05:24.280 --> 05:26.110
No shoots, and you haven't signed with an agency?

05:26.670 --> 05:27.700
Sign with an agency?

05:27.760 --> 05:28.790
What does that mean?

05:28.870 --> 05:30.950
Professional models all need to sign with agencies,

05:31.260 --> 05:32.740
and they need managers too.

05:33.920 --> 05:36.400
I thought only celebrities needed managers.

05:36.430 --> 05:38.230
Models have managers as well.

05:40.940 --> 05:43.570
Why don't you both sign on as my models?

05:44.590 --> 05:45.550
Don't be nervous.

05:45.950 --> 05:47.670
I just think your conditions

05:47.670 --> 05:48.830
are very good.

05:48.830 --> 05:51.060
You'll definitely have great development in the future.

05:51.390 --> 05:54.230
So I sincerely invite you to join my company.

05:55.450 --> 05:56.140
How about this?

05:56.140 --> 05:57.070
I'll get you a contract first,

05:57.150 --> 05:58.240
and you can take a look at it,

05:58.240 --> 05:58.590
okay?

05:58.590 --> 05:59.950
We can discuss if you have any questions.

06:00.180 --> 06:01.180
Okay.

06:01.550 --> 06:02.310
Wait for me.

06:11.480 --> 06:13.790
Look at you, acting like you're so new to everything.

06:13.830 --> 06:14.910
What now?

06:14.930 --> 06:17.390
He mentioned signing a contract, and you got all flustered.

06:17.390 --> 06:18.310
Was that really necessary?

06:18.330 --> 06:19.590
I just think

06:19.590 --> 06:21.350
it's a bit strange that he wants to

06:21.470 --> 06:22.470
sign a contract with us

06:22.990 --> 06:24.240
at our first meeting, right?

06:24.530 --> 06:25.550
Let's look over the contract first.

06:25.590 --> 06:26.380
We'll decide after that.

06:26.410 --> 06:27.790
If anything seems off,

06:27.790 --> 06:29.040
we'll just walk away.

06:37.730 --> 06:38.480
Hai.

06:40.560 --> 06:41.600
We have new girls?

06:42.950 --> 06:43.950
I met them in town.

06:46.230 --> 06:47.200
Fresh meat.

06:48.630 --> 06:50.590
One of them is a real gem.

06:51.170 --> 06:53.970
Fair skin, a beautiful face, and long legs.

06:58.110 --> 07:05.430
[Radiology Department]

07:01.470 --> 07:02.690
Are you nervous?

07:02.910 --> 07:03.780
I'm fine.

07:03.870 --> 07:06.390
It's okay. Let's have a check.

07:25.480 --> 07:27.060
It's okay. Don't be afraid.

07:27.000 --> 07:29.180
[Registration; Special Examination Appointment; Report Collection]

07:28.910 --> 07:30.470
No. 73, Qi Meiyun.

07:31.270 --> 07:32.550
Here, she's calling us.

07:32.550 --> 07:33.480
She's calling us.

07:35.230 --> 07:37.430
Don't be afraid. I'll wait right here for you.

07:37.430 --> 07:38.360
I'll wait for you here.

07:38.360 --> 07:38.990
Okay.

07:40.270 --> 07:42.140
Don't be nervous, Granny.

07:42.470 --> 07:44.380
Right, right, this, take this.

07:44.830 --> 07:45.840
I'll be waiting right here for you.

07:45.870 --> 07:46.390
Okay.

07:47.159 --> 07:48.550
Call me if you need anything.

07:48.590 --> 07:50.590
Don't be nervous. Just listen to the doctor.

07:50.590 --> 07:51.210
Okay.

07:55.760 --> 07:58.010
If you have any questions, you can ask me.

07:58.110 --> 08:00.070
Because these are all standard agency contracts.

08:00.100 --> 08:01.600
That's the way it's done in the business.

08:01.910 --> 08:03.230
If you sign the contract today,

08:03.230 --> 08:04.270
I'll pay you in cash directly.

08:04.290 --> 08:05.100
10,000 yuan for each of you.

08:06.280 --> 08:07.080
Really?

08:07.910 --> 08:09.280
800 yuan per ad

08:09.310 --> 08:10.930
and at least one ad per week.

08:11.260 --> 08:12.310
For students like you,

08:12.350 --> 08:14.830
I think these terms are probably the best you can get.

08:18.570 --> 08:19.540
Give me a pen.

08:22.440 --> 08:24.170
Okay, looking forward to working with you.

08:42.350 --> 08:43.580
One pen for each of you.

08:45.330 --> 08:46.400
Wait, wait.

08:46.530 --> 08:47.710
Let's take the contract back first

08:47.710 --> 08:48.950
and discuss it with our families before signing.

08:49.030 --> 08:50.350
There's no need to discuss it.

08:50.350 --> 08:51.710
My parents don't understand this industry anyway.

08:51.710 --> 08:52.670
It's pointless to ask them.

08:53.250 --> 08:54.410
There's a penalty clause,

08:54.440 --> 08:55.750
five times the signing bonus.

08:55.780 --> 08:57.520
If we take 10,000 yuan, we'd have to pay back 50,000 yuan if we cancel.

08:59.480 --> 09:01.800
[Once there is a breach of contract, the breaching party needs to pay the other party a penalty of 50,000 Chinese Yuan (RMB).]

08:59.480 --> 09:01.800
[After the contract is signed, Party A shall pay Party B a signing fee of 10,000 Chinese Yuan (RMB).]

09:00.810 --> 09:01.860
It's like this.

09:01.890 --> 09:03.710
If you don't deliberately break the contract,

09:03.710 --> 09:05.470
you won't have to worry about penalties.

09:05.570 --> 09:10.370
[7. Party A guarantees that it possesses the legal qualifications and the capacity to conduct business.]

09:06.110 --> 09:07.450
Check the next clause.

09:07.510 --> 09:08.860
Party A guarantees

09:08.980 --> 09:11.250
that the work arranged for Party B

09:11.280 --> 09:12.470
will fully adhere to

09:12.470 --> 09:15.070
all laws and relevant regulations

09:15.090 --> 09:16.530
of the People's Republic of China.

09:16.560 --> 09:19.110
If it doesn't, Party B reserves the right to refuse.

09:20.810 --> 09:22.380
This clause is enough then.

09:24.370 --> 09:26.380
At least let Wanghe and the others take a look at it.

09:27.140 --> 09:28.080
Give it to me.

09:28.100 --> 09:29.810
Signing a contract is not a joke.

09:30.030 --> 09:30.830
Give it to me!

09:30.850 --> 09:32.760
Hai, if we don't sign today,

09:32.830 --> 09:34.230
can we still sign later?

09:34.620 --> 09:35.150
Yes,

09:35.170 --> 09:36.090
no problem.

09:36.110 --> 09:37.070
You can sign anytime.

09:37.640 --> 09:39.200
It's just

09:39.530 --> 09:43.060
that the 10,000 yuan today could... drop to 5,000 yuan

09:43.090 --> 09:44.120
and then...

09:44.250 --> 09:45.410
3,000 yuan in the end...

09:46.490 --> 09:47.360
Give it to me.

09:47.660 --> 09:48.380
Give it to me.

09:48.380 --> 09:49.510
Don't...

09:49.670 --> 09:50.990
Can't we just sign it in a few days?

09:51.010 --> 09:52.080
No!

09:56.670 --> 09:58.760
[Party B: Xia Fenghua]

10:01.100 --> 10:01.900
Here you are.

10:02.210 --> 10:02.730
Okay.

10:14.540 --> 10:18.340
[Medical Ethics and Mutual Support]

10:17.100 --> 10:17.860
Granny.

10:19.370 --> 10:20.250
What are the results?

10:20.470 --> 10:22.510
The doctor said everything's fine.

10:23.070 --> 10:24.030
Are you relieved?

10:24.070 --> 10:25.810
I'm relieved, really.

10:25.390 --> 10:29.290
[Medical Ethics and Mutual Support]

10:26.870 --> 10:29.360
Guess who I just ran into while picking up the results?

10:29.570 --> 10:30.810
District Chief Gu.

10:31.140 --> 10:31.980
District Chief Gu.

10:32.010 --> 10:33.620
When she heard that you came here for a check-up,

10:33.640 --> 10:34.960
she hurriedly

10:33.750 --> 10:41.110
[Medical Ethics and Mutual Support]

10:34.990 --> 10:36.280
had me bring you the health supplements

10:36.350 --> 10:37.650
that were meant for Chen Rui.

10:37.760 --> 10:39.710
I can't take them. Aren't these for the child?

10:40.060 --> 10:40.950
District Chief Gu said

10:41.150 --> 10:41.910
that Chen Rui

10:41.980 --> 10:43.660
grew up under your care,

10:43.690 --> 10:45.360
so this is the least she could do.

10:46.460 --> 10:48.350
She specifically asked me to tell you

10:48.390 --> 10:51.930
that prevention is more important than treatment.

10:52.130 --> 10:53.700
Well, where is she now?

10:53.730 --> 10:55.010
I should thank her in person.

10:55.030 --> 10:56.700
She left already.

10:57.560 --> 10:58.890
She's very busy.

11:00.910 --> 11:03.010
Just take these since she's given them to you.

11:03.860 --> 11:04.990
Her husband, Chen Bo,

11:04.990 --> 11:07.070
often visits our Flower Street when he's free, right?

11:06.490 --> 11:10.930
[In Rescue]

11:07.090 --> 11:09.030
You'll have a chance to thank her eventually.

11:09.750 --> 11:11.650
If you still feel uneasy,

11:10.930 --> 11:17.350
[Payment Collection] [Registration]

11:11.750 --> 11:13.510
Shao shares an office with him.

11:13.840 --> 11:16.070
We can have Shao arrange it.

11:16.070 --> 11:17.000
Okay.

11:25.890 --> 11:27.180
Are you still angry,

11:27.210 --> 11:28.370
Miss Grudge-holder?

11:28.410 --> 11:29.270
I'm not.

11:29.480 --> 11:30.670
You clearly are.

11:30.700 --> 11:31.930
I know you too well.

11:32.920 --> 11:34.350
Don't be mad.

11:34.620 --> 11:35.150
Come on.

11:35.180 --> 11:36.210
Give me a smile.

11:41.700 --> 11:45.100
To you, this may seem like a huge risk,

11:45.150 --> 11:47.030
but to our parents' generation,

11:47.050 --> 11:48.220
it's nothing at all.

11:48.370 --> 11:49.320
Oh, please.

11:49.350 --> 11:51.360
Both of your parents are honest people,

11:51.380 --> 11:53.340
unlike you, so daring.

11:54.100 --> 11:56.180
Do you know what my mom was doing

11:56.190 --> 11:57.400
at my age?

11:57.700 --> 11:58.570
What?

11:58.590 --> 12:00.110
Stealing coal to sell.

12:00.780 --> 12:02.240
Back then,

12:02.610 --> 12:04.410
my uncle wanted to go to college,

12:04.440 --> 12:05.540
but the family couldn't afford it.

12:05.600 --> 12:07.590
So my mom and other girls from the village

12:07.810 --> 12:09.950
would row a small boat to the canal to steal coal.

12:10.130 --> 12:11.190
But once,

12:11.230 --> 12:13.260
they accidentally stole from Uncle Xie's and my dad's ship.

12:13.670 --> 12:14.990
They got caught red-handed,

12:15.010 --> 12:16.520
and that's how she ended up with my dad for life.

12:16.750 --> 12:18.420
That's really sad.

12:22.300 --> 12:24.510
She's really been through a lot for her family.

12:25.380 --> 12:26.640
After she had me,

12:26.660 --> 12:28.010
and I'm a girl,

12:28.050 --> 12:29.270
my grandmother has looked down on her.

12:29.300 --> 12:30.940
She's always throwing little jabs at my mom.

12:31.630 --> 12:33.340
So, I've always had this urge

12:33.360 --> 12:34.930
to make my mom proud

12:35.270 --> 12:37.560
and give her something to brag about.

12:37.990 --> 12:39.660
Unfortunately, I'm really not that bright,

12:39.710 --> 12:40.750
and my grades are terrible,

12:40.770 --> 12:41.820
always embarrassing her.

12:45.870 --> 12:47.060
Doing commercials

12:47.530 --> 12:49.210
is my only chance right now.

12:50.160 --> 12:51.660
Otherwise, I wouldn't be in such a hurry.

12:51.760 --> 12:55.220
[Haizi Model Agency Contract]

12:58.820 --> 13:00.540
I can already imagine

13:00.570 --> 13:03.400
how happy my mom will be when she sees the money.

13:08.140 --> 13:09.460
I'll sign next week too.

13:12.690 --> 13:13.880
First, I'll pay off the debts,

13:13.900 --> 13:15.620
and then I'll give the rest to my grandma.

13:19.820 --> 13:21.450
She'll definitely say,

13:21.480 --> 13:23.720
"I won't spend a penny of this money."

13:23.750 --> 13:25.400
"I'll save it all for your dowry."

13:26.300 --> 13:27.470
How much has she saved?

13:28.470 --> 13:29.350
I don't know.

13:29.420 --> 13:31.620
She has an account book, very thick.

13:31.660 --> 13:34.280
The first page still records my dad's bride price.

13:34.670 --> 13:37.160
People nowadays are all about writing blogs.

13:37.180 --> 13:38.280
For their generation,

13:38.300 --> 13:39.980
their account books are their blogs.

13:48.580 --> 13:49.710
All this fuss

13:49.710 --> 13:50.480
has taken up half the day.

13:52.050 --> 13:53.790
I do feel a bit tired now.

13:53.830 --> 13:54.710
Right?

13:56.630 --> 13:57.310
How about this?

13:57.830 --> 13:59.440
You should go back to your room and rest.

13:59.540 --> 14:00.650
Don't worry about anything.

14:00.870 --> 14:02.470
Well, when Siyi gets back,

14:02.490 --> 14:04.100
have her come to my place for dinner.

14:04.120 --> 14:04.470
Okay.

14:04.470 --> 14:04.710
Okay?

14:04.710 --> 14:05.110
Okay, okay.

14:05.110 --> 14:06.630
And when you wake up, just call me.

14:06.630 --> 14:07.930
I'll bring your meal over.

14:07.990 --> 14:08.590
Okay, just leave it here.

14:08.590 --> 14:09.510
I've put it here for you.

14:12.860 --> 14:13.530
Yuling.

14:17.760 --> 14:18.820
How did the check-up go?

14:19.790 --> 14:21.740
Her blood pressure and cholesterol levels are a bit high,

14:21.770 --> 14:23.550
while other indicators are normal though.

14:23.750 --> 14:25.080
The doctor said

14:25.290 --> 14:26.340
that she can't overexert herself,

14:26.360 --> 14:27.400
has to avoid getting angry,

14:27.470 --> 14:28.710
and has to stay away from high-fat,

14:28.740 --> 14:30.780
high-calorie, and greasy foods.

14:30.830 --> 14:32.110
Just the usual advice.

14:32.110 --> 14:34.320
What did they say about the stroke risk?

14:34.360 --> 14:35.500
They didn't mention that specifically.

14:37.260 --> 14:38.820
But to be honest,

14:39.010 --> 14:40.870
I don't think she's in very good health.

14:41.060 --> 14:42.290
Think about it.

14:42.310 --> 14:43.830
Before, she could be on her feet all day,

14:43.860 --> 14:45.400
full of energy,

14:45.430 --> 14:46.830
and still walk briskly too.

14:46.980 --> 14:48.230
But today,

14:48.250 --> 14:49.820
the check-up only took half a day.

14:49.940 --> 14:51.430
How much walking could we have done?

14:52.300 --> 14:53.350
Yet she was worn out.

14:53.350 --> 14:55.430
See? She lay down as soon as she got home.

14:55.520 --> 14:56.690
She is not that energetic anymore.

14:57.090 --> 14:58.010
So,

14:58.100 --> 14:59.290
just in case,

14:59.580 --> 15:02.790
we still need to do a drill in advance.

15:02.820 --> 15:03.950
A drill?

15:03.990 --> 15:05.230
If she has an episode at home,

15:05.630 --> 15:07.710
from our compound to where we can get a car,

15:07.730 --> 15:09.490
it's at least 300 meters, right?

15:09.520 --> 15:10.040
Yes.

15:10.060 --> 15:11.110
Plus, we'll have to cross the bridge.

15:11.140 --> 15:13.010
After crossing the bridge, we need to have a car prepared in advance.

15:13.040 --> 15:14.480
Once at the hospital, she'll need emergency treatment.

15:14.520 --> 15:15.370
With this illness...

15:15.980 --> 15:17.840
it's all about time.

15:26.580 --> 15:27.390
Start.

15:28.440 --> 15:29.050
Hurry.

15:29.080 --> 15:30.920
One, two, go.

15:30.940 --> 15:33.260
Easy now. Watch your step.

15:36.440 --> 15:37.410
Watch the road.

15:37.430 --> 15:38.390
An uphill.

15:42.150 --> 15:42.630
Mr. Zhou!

15:42.630 --> 15:43.120
What happened?

15:43.120 --> 15:43.870
Make way, make way!

15:43.870 --> 15:45.190
It's nothing, just a drill.

15:45.190 --> 15:46.110
Don't worry.

15:46.110 --> 15:47.200
We'll explain later.

15:47.310 --> 15:47.960
Slowly.

15:47.960 --> 15:49.000
A drill?

15:50.880 --> 15:52.440
Are you tired?

15:52.560 --> 15:54.400
How about... I carry you instead for a while?

15:54.510 --> 15:55.510
You... stop talking.

15:55.510 --> 15:56.350
Save your energy.

15:56.370 --> 15:57.020
Actually, I'm fine.

15:57.070 --> 15:57.990
Let me tell you,

15:57.990 --> 15:59.590
before, I could carry a sofa on my head

15:59.590 --> 16:01.290
from the South Gate Market all the way back,

16:01.350 --> 16:01.870
easy peasy.

16:01.870 --> 16:02.390
Really?

16:02.390 --> 16:02.990
There are steps ahead.

16:06.160 --> 16:06.630
Mom!

16:06.630 --> 16:07.550
Careful now.

16:07.840 --> 16:08.570
What happened?

16:08.600 --> 16:09.150
Mom?

16:09.190 --> 16:09.830
Get out of the way.

16:09.870 --> 16:11.300
What's wrong with you?

16:11.350 --> 16:12.070
What's wrong with you?

16:12.070 --> 16:13.110
Hurry up, go, go.

16:13.110 --> 16:14.260
Don't waste our time.

16:14.290 --> 16:15.720
What's wrong with my mom?

16:15.770 --> 16:17.030
What's really wrong with you?

16:17.230 --> 16:17.720
Mom!

16:17.750 --> 16:19.420
The three of us were playing cards.

16:19.470 --> 16:20.350
Your Aunt Liang lost.

16:20.350 --> 16:21.210
This is her punishment.

16:21.410 --> 16:22.230
Are you crazy?

16:22.230 --> 16:23.940
Who are you trying to scare this late at night?

16:24.110 --> 16:24.870
Cut the crap.

16:24.870 --> 16:25.790
Just go away now.

16:25.830 --> 16:27.070
Everything is fine. Everything is fine.

16:27.070 --> 16:28.230
It's fine. Hurry up and go home now.

16:32.210 --> 16:33.970
-Here, here.
-Okay.

16:34.080 --> 16:34.960
My goodness.

16:35.640 --> 16:36.920
Is your waist okay?

16:42.880 --> 16:44.750
It takes at least three minutes to get here.

16:44.780 --> 16:45.660
Then, adding the time to find a car and drive there,

16:45.680 --> 16:47.540
it'll take another ten minutes or so to get to the hospital.

16:49.170 --> 16:51.400
The key is the car. We have to have it ready at all times.

16:51.470 --> 16:53.210
If we only start looking for one when we get here, it'll be too late.

16:53.230 --> 16:54.880
We can have a tricycle ready at all times,

16:54.990 --> 16:56.920
but where can we find a car to keep on standby?

17:02.340 --> 17:05.040
Granny Ma... almost weighs as much as the two of you, right?

17:05.060 --> 17:06.230
That's true, true.

17:06.569 --> 17:07.770
That won't do.

17:09.130 --> 17:10.619
We need to get a stretcher.

17:11.220 --> 17:11.750
Right.

17:11.770 --> 17:12.390
I'll make one.

17:12.410 --> 17:13.210
I'll help you.

17:14.310 --> 17:15.349
Just in case.

17:15.349 --> 17:16.200
We need to have one prepared.

17:17.339 --> 17:18.040
Okay.

17:18.079 --> 17:19.190
It's settled then.

17:19.910 --> 17:21.220
Drill's over!

17:21.240 --> 17:22.180
Let's go home.

17:22.200 --> 17:22.849
Let's go.

17:23.790 --> 17:24.859
Hold her, hold her.

17:24.890 --> 17:25.960
I'm holding her.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.940
Fenghua, dinner's ready!

17:34.570 --> 17:35.730
You startled me.

17:41.340 --> 17:42.390
What's going on with you?

17:45.320 --> 17:47.200
Mom, sit down first.

17:51.050 --> 17:52.290
What's going on?

17:57.270 --> 17:58.880
What's all this about?

17:59.080 --> 18:00.620
Open it and take a look.

18:12.910 --> 18:14.490
Where did you get it?

18:14.540 --> 18:15.560
I earned it.

18:15.590 --> 18:16.850
How did you earn it?

18:17.220 --> 18:18.300
Guess.

18:18.490 --> 18:20.040
Stop teasing and just tell me.

18:21.290 --> 18:24.140
Wasn't there a photographer at the stall the other day?

18:24.160 --> 18:25.600
I signed a contract with him

18:25.640 --> 18:26.830
to be an advertising model.

18:27.140 --> 18:28.460
This is the signing bonus.

18:30.380 --> 18:33.280
[Haizi Model Agency Contract]

18:30.910 --> 18:31.850
This is the contract.

18:40.380 --> 18:41.400
Don't worry.

18:41.610 --> 18:42.480
I've gone through it carefully.

18:42.510 --> 18:43.510
Everything's legitimate.

18:50.580 --> 18:52.050
You stay put.

18:52.150 --> 18:53.760
I'll deal with you when I get back.

18:54.830 --> 18:56.520
Mom, where are you going?

19:10.070 --> 19:12.460
Haizi Modeling Agency?

19:10.150 --> 19:13.400
[Haizi Model Agency Contract]

19:16.370 --> 19:17.860
They must be out of their minds.

19:18.350 --> 19:19.240
Is there...

19:19.270 --> 19:20.710
is there something fishy with this contract?

19:20.740 --> 19:21.630
See? I knew

19:21.630 --> 19:23.190
there had to be something fishy with this contract.

19:23.470 --> 19:26.520
They signed Fenghua as their model

19:26.860 --> 19:28.920
and gave her a 10,000 yuan signing bonus?

19:29.110 --> 19:31.020
They must be either crazy or blind.

19:36.480 --> 19:37.030
Auntie.

19:37.030 --> 19:37.870
Don't say anything else.

19:38.300 --> 19:39.790
To each their own.

19:39.820 --> 19:41.620
We're asking you to look over the contract

19:41.670 --> 19:43.160
and see if there are any traps in it.

19:43.200 --> 19:44.520
Take a close look at it.

19:46.970 --> 19:48.060
Auntie, Fenghua is quite pretty.

19:48.080 --> 19:49.690
Come on, take a look.

19:51.120 --> 19:54.390
[Haizi Model Agency Contract]

19:51.560 --> 19:54.350
At face value, there doesn't seem to be any problem with this contract.

19:54.550 --> 19:56.830
The contract states that the work arranged by Party A must be legal.

19:56.870 --> 19:57.990
With this clause,

19:57.990 --> 19:59.770
Fenghua won't be at too much risk.

20:00.800 --> 20:01.630
Is that so?

20:01.670 --> 20:02.880
Then I can rest assured.

20:02.910 --> 20:04.100
However...

20:04.620 --> 20:06.130
there's a...

20:06.150 --> 20:08.160
50,000 RMB penalty clause for breach of contract.

20:08.200 --> 20:09.640
If we ever breach the contract,

20:09.700 --> 20:10.890
then we'll have to pay the penalty.

20:10.920 --> 20:11.630
Here.

20:13.530 --> 20:14.330
50,000 yuan?

20:14.910 --> 20:16.040
50,000 yuan...

20:16.060 --> 20:18.220
Where am I supposed to find 50,000 yuan for her?

20:18.250 --> 20:18.690
Auntie,

20:19.340 --> 20:21.300
as long as she doesn't actively terminate the contract with them,

20:21.320 --> 20:22.490
she won't need to pay any penalties.

20:22.790 --> 20:24.470
If Fenghua can really make money from this,

20:24.510 --> 20:25.710
then she should go ahead and do it.

20:25.710 --> 20:26.590
800 yuan per ad.

20:26.770 --> 20:28.050
With Fenghua's qualifications,

20:28.050 --> 20:29.670
where else could she earn that much money?

20:30.250 --> 20:32.310
What if they're scammers?

20:36.020 --> 20:37.300
We need to look into that.

20:37.330 --> 20:39.120
When Fenghua goes there next time,

20:39.140 --> 20:40.270
I'll go with her.

20:40.300 --> 20:41.520
Let's see how it goes and then decide.

20:41.830 --> 20:42.960
That's great.

20:42.980 --> 20:44.720
I'm so glad you'll be with her.

20:44.810 --> 20:45.620
You don't need to worry.

20:45.750 --> 20:46.510
I'm going to do my homework now.

20:46.510 --> 20:47.390
Okay, okay.

20:49.000 --> 20:49.710
See?

20:50.710 --> 20:52.990
Wanghe never gives us anything to worry about.

21:03.890 --> 21:05.020
What's wrong?

21:05.060 --> 21:06.110
Are you scared by this?

21:06.930 --> 21:08.830
Leave me alone. I'm annoyed.

21:10.950 --> 21:11.960
Alright, then.

21:12.000 --> 21:13.190
Then, I'll spend...

21:13.230 --> 21:14.210
this money myself.

21:14.770 --> 21:15.890
In your dreams.

21:16.710 --> 21:17.660
What?

21:17.670 --> 21:19.790
Can't I spend the money I earned myself?

21:22.060 --> 21:23.070
What do you want to buy?

21:24.870 --> 21:25.700
A phone.

21:25.790 --> 21:27.030
The latest model.

21:27.550 --> 21:29.280
Is that really necessary?

21:29.390 --> 21:30.390
For my dad.

21:31.350 --> 21:32.490
Your dad already has a phone.

21:33.840 --> 21:35.230
He's been using

21:35.230 --> 21:36.470
that old Nokia for years.

21:36.510 --> 21:37.350
It's embarrassing.

21:37.770 --> 21:38.570
Get him a new one

21:38.660 --> 21:39.890
so that he'll have face wherever he goes.

21:45.100 --> 21:47.180
And I'll get you a new watch too.

21:47.270 --> 21:49.670
Your old one keeps breaking down and needing repairs.

21:49.710 --> 21:51.030
And the case is all worn out.

21:53.510 --> 21:54.590
What about yourself?

21:58.160 --> 21:59.710
I want a lipstick,

21:59.750 --> 22:00.550
150 yuan.

22:00.550 --> 22:01.190
Anything else?

22:01.950 --> 22:02.870
That's all.

22:02.900 --> 22:05.270
The watch and phone already cost several thousand yuan.

22:05.390 --> 22:06.390
There's not much money left.

22:09.300 --> 22:10.110
We're not buying anything.

22:10.870 --> 22:13.020
I'll save all the money for you as your dowry.

22:13.070 --> 22:14.510
No way!

22:15.030 --> 22:16.850
I finally have a chance to prove myself for once.

22:16.950 --> 22:18.870
Can you just let me have my moment?

22:20.310 --> 22:21.350
Later, when you're out on the street

22:21.370 --> 22:22.250
and someone asks you,

22:22.890 --> 22:24.290
"You got a new watch?"

22:24.850 --> 22:26.540
"My daughter bought it for me."

22:26.580 --> 22:27.620
How wonderful is that?

22:29.070 --> 22:29.870
Okay.

22:30.470 --> 22:31.310
I'll get a new watch then.

22:31.350 --> 22:33.280
But we don't need to buy a new phone for your dad.

22:33.340 --> 22:34.160
He doesn't have much business to do.

22:34.180 --> 22:35.270
He doesn't need it.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.950
No, we must get him a new one.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.560
Later, when my dad gets a new phone

22:38.710 --> 22:40.600
and shows it off in front of Uncle Xie.

22:40.880 --> 22:42.150
"Look, look."

22:42.630 --> 22:44.470
"My daughter bought this for me."

22:44.520 --> 22:47.270
"Let your son buy you a new cell phone someday, huh?"

22:47.300 --> 22:49.640
Then Wanghe will get another beating.

22:50.800 --> 22:52.480
You bad girl.

22:54.030 --> 22:54.960
Remember.

22:55.780 --> 22:57.100
In the future, for any matter,

22:57.120 --> 22:59.370
always discuss it with your family first.

22:59.540 --> 23:01.100
I'm afraid you'll be taken advantage of.

23:02.720 --> 23:03.600
Did you hear me?

23:03.920 --> 23:05.440
I'm being serious here.

23:09.290 --> 23:11.100
Your dad is here to support the family.

23:11.200 --> 23:12.080
We don't need you to do that.

23:13.880 --> 23:15.220
I know, I know.

23:26.470 --> 23:27.030
Boss.

23:28.130 --> 23:28.860
Come on.

23:30.650 --> 23:32.140
Are you out of your mind?

23:33.290 --> 23:34.050
Your liver doesn't hurt anymore?

23:34.070 --> 23:35.450
Not afraid of your wife scolding you anymore?

23:36.510 --> 23:37.900
Let her scold me if she wants.

23:38.050 --> 23:39.660
Well, let's drink first.

23:39.700 --> 23:40.470
Come on, come on.

23:41.770 --> 23:43.210
The heck with it. I'm already like this.

23:54.010 --> 23:54.770
Have you lost your spirit?

23:57.030 --> 23:58.440
It's just the beginning.

24:00.370 --> 24:01.580
All of these setbacks...

24:02.490 --> 24:04.270
are all temporary.

24:09.200 --> 24:11.500
It's okay if we just can't

24:12.060 --> 24:13.200
get the money back.

24:14.340 --> 24:15.980
We can always earn more, right?

24:16.960 --> 24:19.430
These days, I keep feeling that... the...

24:21.990 --> 24:23.200
the Grand Canal...

24:25.770 --> 24:26.660
is finished.

24:29.190 --> 24:30.190
Have you noticed?

24:30.190 --> 24:31.150
These days,

24:31.510 --> 24:34.950
there are fewer and fewer ships on the river,

24:35.240 --> 24:36.630
while the cars on the highway

24:36.630 --> 24:38.390
are increasing day by day.

24:40.710 --> 24:41.950
I'm getting...

24:43.080 --> 24:44.260
really anxious.

24:44.260 --> 24:46.350
I'm in a complete panic.

24:52.330 --> 24:53.460
Let me tell you.

24:54.630 --> 24:57.080
This is all... all temporary.

24:57.520 --> 24:58.600
It will pass.

25:00.020 --> 25:00.670
Right?

25:01.090 --> 25:02.650
Mr. Zhou said

25:02.770 --> 25:04.070
that this Grand Canal

25:04.070 --> 25:07.490
was dug since the Spring and Autumn period.

25:08.540 --> 25:10.660
It took over two thousand years to complete it.

25:10.790 --> 25:12.080
It's witnessed so many dynasties

25:12.110 --> 25:14.070
and supported so many people.

25:15.700 --> 25:17.690
As long as we don't give up on it,

25:18.480 --> 25:19.720
I firmly believe

25:19.760 --> 25:21.800
that this canal will also not give up on us.

25:22.680 --> 25:24.510
I hope it's like that too.

25:24.760 --> 25:25.810
Right?

25:26.590 --> 25:28.620
You know, I've been following you since we were kids.

25:29.990 --> 25:33.880
Well, whatever we do, you've always called the shots.

25:34.080 --> 25:36.070
You make all the big decisions and major ideas,

25:36.070 --> 25:37.390
and I just follow your lead.

25:37.910 --> 25:39.770
I'll do whatever you say.

25:40.440 --> 25:41.120
But...

25:44.390 --> 25:46.570
but now I'm really starting to feel...

25:47.230 --> 25:48.550
feel like I can't hold on much longer.

25:54.510 --> 25:56.990
Just think about how many days we've fallen behind

25:56.990 --> 25:58.550
on paying the dividends we owe to each family.

26:00.830 --> 26:02.510
We all live in the same compound,

26:02.510 --> 26:04.750
seeing each other every day.

26:08.890 --> 26:11.390
My family's living expenses are about to run out.

26:15.530 --> 26:17.730
Next year, Fenghua will be taking the college entrance exam.

26:18.530 --> 26:20.610
If she doesn't get in, that's fine.

26:21.120 --> 26:23.290
But what if she does?

26:24.070 --> 26:26.880
Where will I get the money for her tuition, Tiancheng?

26:28.790 --> 26:30.550
You also want to sell the ship?

26:39.460 --> 26:40.130
But...

26:40.150 --> 26:43.030
we bought this ship to make money, right?

26:44.470 --> 26:46.580
Not for sentimental reasons, right?

26:46.610 --> 26:48.320
But if we don't do seafaring,

26:48.350 --> 26:49.230
what are we going to do?

26:52.000 --> 26:52.840
Tiancheng,

26:53.620 --> 26:54.700
look...

26:54.940 --> 26:57.080
your destiny is tied to the water.

26:57.120 --> 26:59.820
Can't we find a place by the river...

27:00.400 --> 27:02.430
and do some fish farming or something?

27:02.450 --> 27:04.410
My brother-in-law knows an expert from Shanghai.

27:04.440 --> 27:05.400
He said

27:05.420 --> 27:07.580
that raising eels or turtles can make money.

27:07.830 --> 27:08.390
At the very least,

27:08.410 --> 27:09.940
we could set up a fish pond

27:10.540 --> 27:11.820
and start a farmstay.

27:11.900 --> 27:13.140
That's still better than this

27:13.180 --> 27:14.730
half-dead state we're in now, right?

27:34.560 --> 27:35.440
Mom.

27:36.030 --> 27:38.270
Your waist hasn't recovered yet. Why are you running?

27:38.540 --> 27:39.750
See? You're in pain again.

27:49.140 --> 27:51.300
You need to wear this back brace even when you sleep at night.

27:51.510 --> 27:53.460
Won't that give me a rash around my waist?

27:53.730 --> 27:55.520
That's still better than a sore back, isn't it?

27:56.070 --> 27:57.240
The doctor said...

27:58.250 --> 27:59.260
that if you don't rest,

27:59.260 --> 28:00.420
your waist will be easily affected by the cold.

28:01.660 --> 28:03.630
Stop worrying about me.

28:03.810 --> 28:05.130
If you have this much spare time,

28:05.140 --> 28:06.900
go hit the books.

28:09.960 --> 28:10.970
Are you feeling better?

28:12.680 --> 28:13.740
Much better.

28:16.240 --> 28:17.590
It's just that I can't do

28:17.620 --> 28:19.320
any heavy work for a while.

28:19.590 --> 28:21.020
I'll need to rest for a while.

28:21.300 --> 28:22.300
Come and eat.

28:22.580 --> 28:23.300
Alright.

28:23.320 --> 28:24.590
Then you should rest.

28:24.750 --> 28:26.050
Take it as a break.

28:26.620 --> 28:28.630
There's not much business on the streets lately anyway.

28:30.500 --> 28:31.750
You drink first.

28:31.750 --> 28:32.780
There are more dishes coming.

28:52.330 --> 28:53.810
How much money do we have left at home?

28:55.730 --> 28:57.060
Not much.

29:01.990 --> 29:03.360
Why do you ask?

29:04.250 --> 29:05.990
Didn't Chen Bo publish a book?

29:08.150 --> 29:09.670
So, I'm planning to self-publish one.

29:10.710 --> 29:11.470
Self-publish?

29:14.400 --> 29:16.220
I was just thinking...

29:16.710 --> 29:17.890
you see...

29:18.450 --> 29:20.740
our son will be going to college next year, right?

29:21.090 --> 29:22.970
Shouldn't we save more money for him?

29:32.830 --> 29:33.710
Forget it.

29:36.550 --> 29:38.630
I'll go chase Boss Xie for our dividend.

29:40.460 --> 29:42.010
No, no, no.

29:42.540 --> 29:45.160
If he hasn't given it, it means he's in a tough spot.

29:45.180 --> 29:46.110
If he is earning money,

29:46.150 --> 29:47.430
hasn't he already given us?

29:47.470 --> 29:47.790
Don't go.

29:47.790 --> 29:50.190
No, but he can't always be in a tight spot.

29:50.680 --> 29:52.520
How long has he owed us now?

29:53.210 --> 29:55.460
If he really had no business, I wouldn't say anything.

29:55.810 --> 29:56.910
But Boss Xie,

29:57.270 --> 29:58.670
he's shipping trip by trip.

29:58.750 --> 30:00.110
If he's not making money,

30:00.150 --> 30:01.310
why is he bothering with all of this?

30:01.330 --> 30:03.100
He might as well sell the ship.

30:03.430 --> 30:04.160
Listen to me.

30:04.160 --> 30:05.600
I've thought it through.

30:05.630 --> 30:06.430
I'll learn embroidery.

30:06.430 --> 30:07.910
Once I get the hang of it, I can earn money.

30:07.940 --> 30:09.490
How long will that take?

30:09.510 --> 30:10.560
I've asked around.

30:10.590 --> 30:12.060
There's a big demand in the market.

30:12.090 --> 30:13.100
As long as the quality is good,

30:13.150 --> 30:14.030
we won't have to worry about selling.

30:14.030 --> 30:15.910
I need cash now!

30:15.950 --> 30:18.390
Besides, it's Xie who owes us!

30:18.470 --> 30:20.630
Since when did the debtors get to call the shots?

30:20.790 --> 30:22.090
It's ridiculous, isn't it?

30:22.120 --> 30:22.640
You...

30:25.430 --> 30:26.110
Come...

30:26.740 --> 30:27.510
Mom.

30:28.160 --> 30:29.290
You've strained your back again?

30:30.790 --> 30:32.240
Go sit down, quick.

30:32.550 --> 30:33.310
Easy, easy.

30:41.620 --> 30:43.560
Pay attention. What's on your mind?

30:43.590 --> 30:44.870
You're spilling it everywhere.

30:46.220 --> 30:47.930
What are you thinking about?

30:48.200 --> 30:50.020
About Fenghua's contract,

30:50.060 --> 30:51.600
the more I think about it, the more it doesn't feel right.

30:53.350 --> 30:54.660
Why does it not feel right?

30:54.680 --> 30:57.800
If Siyi signed a contract to be a model, I'd believe it.

30:57.980 --> 30:59.020
Fenghua...

30:59.040 --> 31:00.580
What about her?

31:00.620 --> 31:03.060
Are you saying Fenghua isn't beautiful?

31:03.150 --> 31:03.910
She's rustic.

31:05.270 --> 31:06.450
As if you're so fashionable.

31:06.920 --> 31:08.690
Then why didn't they sign you?

31:08.720 --> 31:10.340
I don't make a living off my looks.

31:10.920 --> 31:12.760
Then what do you make a living off?

31:12.780 --> 31:13.740
Your ability?

31:15.260 --> 31:16.020
Haihong.

31:16.330 --> 31:17.320
Uncle Shao.

31:17.340 --> 31:18.090
Wanghe,

31:18.350 --> 31:19.380
is your dad home?

31:19.480 --> 31:20.110
He's not.

31:20.150 --> 31:21.290
Do you need to see him for something?

31:22.020 --> 31:23.260
No, no, no.

31:24.980 --> 31:26.130
Mr. Shao.

31:29.860 --> 31:33.080
I'll have our Xie find you when he gets back.

31:33.790 --> 31:34.900
Okay.

31:35.750 --> 31:37.110
I'll be off then.

31:51.620 --> 31:52.310
What's the matter?

31:54.580 --> 31:56.070
He came for his dividends.

31:58.270 --> 32:00.050
We can't really blame him.

32:00.190 --> 32:01.070
This time...

32:02.150 --> 32:03.880
it's really been dragged out for far too long.

32:04.710 --> 32:05.960
If I were your father,

32:06.390 --> 32:08.280
I'd be too embarrassed to come home.

32:16.000 --> 32:18.160
Don't always be at odds with Yan.

32:18.190 --> 32:19.150
Alright, alright.

32:21.020 --> 32:21.950
Right?

32:21.950 --> 32:22.430
Yes, yes.

32:22.430 --> 32:23.200
Boss.

32:24.190 --> 32:25.170
Mr. Shao.

32:26.220 --> 32:27.350
My dad is back.

32:27.480 --> 32:28.200
Well...

32:28.650 --> 32:29.750
Light-headed.

32:30.220 --> 32:30.860
Boss?

32:35.770 --> 32:36.740
Well...

32:36.960 --> 32:37.760
Lao'er?

32:38.270 --> 32:40.470
You go back first.

32:40.510 --> 32:42.270
We... we'll chat for a bit.

32:50.270 --> 32:51.420
Please... please go ahead.

32:56.190 --> 32:57.150
It's...

32:57.550 --> 32:59.110
about the dividends.

33:00.190 --> 33:02.670
I'm a bit tight on cash recently,

33:02.670 --> 33:04.150
and I urgently need it.

33:04.790 --> 33:07.200
Otherwise, I wouldn't have brought this up with you.

33:07.780 --> 33:08.630
I understand.

33:09.190 --> 33:10.200
I understand. I understand.

33:11.790 --> 33:14.320
Give me one more week.

33:14.750 --> 33:17.770
I'll definitely... resolve this issue.

33:19.030 --> 33:19.950
One week?

33:21.300 --> 33:22.110
You...

33:22.510 --> 33:25.510
you're... in such a hurry... for money?

33:26.710 --> 33:28.110
It's not that.

33:28.850 --> 33:30.490
I heard

33:30.520 --> 33:33.060
that Crippled Sun even sold his own car

33:33.140 --> 33:34.740
and then ran off.

33:35.760 --> 33:37.490
I'm afraid you'll get scammed.

33:46.080 --> 33:48.000
Then, can you still get back the money

33:48.030 --> 33:49.520
he owes you?

33:54.210 --> 33:55.350
I...

33:57.560 --> 33:59.200
Be careful, be careful.

33:59.360 --> 34:00.960
I... I...

34:01.790 --> 34:03.840
I'll do my best to get it back.

34:06.030 --> 34:07.270
If not,

34:07.540 --> 34:09.630
I still have a backup plan.

34:09.650 --> 34:11.489
You've finally decided to sell the ship?

34:11.870 --> 34:13.159
I've said this before.

34:13.190 --> 34:14.870
The canal business is finished.

34:15.070 --> 34:16.590
If we don't cut our losses now,

34:16.610 --> 34:18.290
we may really end up losing everything.

34:20.190 --> 34:21.870
Are you all...

34:22.719 --> 34:24.400
just waiting for me to sell the ship?

34:26.590 --> 34:28.020
It's just a suggestion.

34:28.710 --> 34:29.699
Whether you take it or not

34:29.989 --> 34:30.960
is up to you.

34:32.010 --> 34:33.489
But I think,

34:34.190 --> 34:36.310
now that we're in a market economy, after all.

34:36.389 --> 34:40.350
Doing business still needs to follow market principles.

34:40.469 --> 34:42.110
We can't do things recklessly.

34:43.110 --> 34:44.280
What do you think?

34:46.750 --> 34:47.550
Right.

34:48.750 --> 34:51.190
What you say... makes sense.

34:52.010 --> 34:52.770
Makes sense.

34:59.070 --> 35:01.310
Wanghe has reviewed the contract.

35:01.440 --> 35:02.470
He said there's no problem with it.

35:08.270 --> 35:09.590
Does shooting commercials

35:09.610 --> 35:10.760
really pay that much?

35:11.290 --> 35:13.260
Still, not just anyone can make money from it.

35:13.740 --> 35:15.900
It means our daughter has good conditions.

35:16.190 --> 35:17.940
They came to us.

35:18.310 --> 35:20.670
If it were someone else, they wouldn't even come to them.

35:30.090 --> 35:31.860
If she can make money from it, let her do it first.

35:32.630 --> 35:34.070
Let her earn the tuition fees first.

35:35.550 --> 35:36.830
With her brain,

35:36.870 --> 35:38.870
though, I'm not sure she'll even get into college.

35:39.750 --> 35:40.550
However,

35:40.950 --> 35:42.150
I think modeling is just a career

35:42.230 --> 35:43.810
that expires with youth.

35:43.990 --> 35:45.520
While she's still young,

35:45.630 --> 35:46.970
she can earn as much as possible.

35:47.390 --> 35:48.870
Once she has enough saved up,

35:48.990 --> 35:50.120
we can open a restaurant.

35:50.400 --> 35:51.670
What restaurant?

35:53.480 --> 35:55.030
With the current economic situation,

35:56.070 --> 35:57.190
anything you open will end up losing money.

35:57.360 --> 35:59.120
But we can't just sit around and do nothing.

36:00.430 --> 36:02.110
I've already tried to persuade Boss Xie...

36:03.670 --> 36:04.590
to sell the ship.

36:08.630 --> 36:09.670
Sell the ship?

36:10.670 --> 36:11.710
What would you do then?

36:13.660 --> 36:14.530
Let's talk about it then.

36:17.150 --> 36:18.590
Anything would make more money

36:18.590 --> 36:19.880
than seafaring.

36:23.960 --> 36:25.390
The canal business is done for.

36:27.480 --> 36:28.990
We need to get ashore as soon as possible...

36:31.300 --> 36:32.880
at any cost.

36:34.080 --> 36:35.860
Is it really as bad as all that?

36:39.670 --> 36:42.570
The fuel prices are rising more and more sharply now.

36:43.670 --> 36:44.670
And labor costs...

36:45.470 --> 36:46.910
are getting more and more expensive.

36:47.950 --> 36:49.430
If there were even a way out,

36:49.430 --> 36:51.430
I wouldn't have tried to persuade Boss Xie...

36:51.770 --> 36:53.330
to sell the ship.

37:12.400 --> 37:16.700
[Haizi Model Agency Contract]

38:00.190 --> 38:01.830
Uncle Shao also advised you to sell the ship?

38:06.950 --> 38:09.870
Now, everyone hopes

38:09.890 --> 38:11.800
that I'll sell this ship.

38:14.120 --> 38:16.700
This ship used to be a golden goose...

38:18.200 --> 38:19.720
but now it has become

38:19.750 --> 38:21.300
a hot potato.

38:22.710 --> 38:24.620
Grandpa Zhou and Granny Ma don't think so.

38:24.660 --> 38:26.100
They support you.

38:29.010 --> 38:30.770
This is also what I feel most guilty about.

38:31.760 --> 38:33.410
They trust me too much.

38:36.530 --> 38:39.450
Actually, back when we were buying the new ship, Haikuo's father...

38:40.160 --> 38:41.620
warned me.

38:41.920 --> 38:45.260
He said that once the highway opened,

38:45.670 --> 38:47.980
it would definitely impact the business on the canal.

38:48.430 --> 38:49.820
I didn't listen to him.

38:55.710 --> 38:56.590
I should just sell it.

38:57.800 --> 39:00.210
I shouldn't let myself alone

39:00.470 --> 39:01.750
affect everyone's interests.

39:04.070 --> 39:04.870
Wait a little longer.

39:06.510 --> 39:07.390
Wait for what?

39:12.660 --> 39:13.750
Give me another year.

39:14.550 --> 39:15.430
I'll make money.

39:16.360 --> 39:17.590
If you want to keep running the ship,

39:17.760 --> 39:18.810
then you run it.

39:19.350 --> 39:21.390
I'll cover the shortfall for you.

39:27.770 --> 39:29.830
Look at how things are now.

39:29.830 --> 39:31.670
Can we afford to wait that long?

39:38.970 --> 39:39.910
Besides,

39:40.760 --> 39:42.830
when your grandfather was alive,

39:43.170 --> 39:45.080
he never took a penny from me.

39:45.670 --> 39:46.790
And now I should take money from you?

39:57.430 --> 39:58.980
The men in our Xie family

39:59.730 --> 40:01.470
all have broad shoulders.

40:01.750 --> 40:03.370
No matter what big trouble comes...

40:04.470 --> 40:06.480
we'll have to bear it ourselves.

40:25.260 --> 40:26.020
What?

40:26.970 --> 40:27.730
This.

40:28.590 --> 40:29.640
How come I have that?

40:30.870 --> 40:31.520
You really don't have it?

40:31.550 --> 40:32.590
No.

40:33.550 --> 40:34.780
I couldn't trick it out of you.

40:36.320 --> 40:37.400
Childish.

40:47.630 --> 40:49.310
Now, the question has already told you

40:49.350 --> 40:51.230
the radii of circles O1 and O2.

40:51.310 --> 40:53.570
It asks you to find the trajectory equation

40:53.630 --> 40:56.230
of the moving point P after the gap.

40:56.260 --> 40:58.700
Alright, have I made this clear for you?

40:58.730 --> 41:00.240
-Yes.
-Yes.

41:00.860 --> 41:02.970
Let me remind you once again.

41:03.000 --> 41:04.850
This is a typical trap question.

41:05.040 --> 41:06.930
If any students still...

41:10.210 --> 41:12.850
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

41:12.000 --> 41:12.990
Do you understand?

41:13.280 --> 41:14.040
I understand.

41:15.090 --> 41:16.220
What are you doing?

41:17.070 --> 41:17.830
Taking notes.

41:17.870 --> 41:18.990
Are you drawing me again?

41:19.020 --> 41:19.670
No.

41:20.830 --> 41:21.950
Give it to me.

41:21.990 --> 41:22.760
Mr. Xu, Mr. Xu.

41:22.800 --> 41:23.670
Mr. Xu, Mr. Xu.

41:23.670 --> 41:24.350
No, no, no.

41:24.390 --> 41:26.030
One, two...

41:27.120 --> 41:28.500
Don't tear it up.

41:28.670 --> 41:32.140
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

41:32.260 --> 41:34.510
[82,000 Students in Our City Take the College Entrance Examination]

41:34.290 --> 41:36.110
What's all this mess?

41:34.660 --> 41:35.330
[College Entrance Examination Underway]

41:36.830 --> 41:38.070
Isn't it written there?

41:38.200 --> 41:39.730
[Test Prep Center Business Plan]

41:39.810 --> 41:41.110
Test prep center?

41:41.670 --> 41:42.740
Business plan?

41:44.460 --> 41:46.010
You're really serious about doing this?

41:47.500 --> 41:48.480
Mr. Xu.

41:49.290 --> 41:50.970
I also want to become the richest person in Honghuai.

41:51.340 --> 41:52.880
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

41:57.350 --> 41:57.880
I'm confiscating this.

41:57.880 --> 41:58.270
Don't, don't.

41:58.320 --> 41:58.590
Mr. Xu!

41:58.590 --> 41:59.350
Sit down.

42:04.710 --> 42:05.760
Mr. Xu.

42:05.800 --> 42:06.910
I need to discuss something with you.

42:07.960 --> 42:08.910
What are you doing?

42:08.940 --> 42:10.900
Why are you holding my arm again? Get off me.

42:11.520 --> 42:12.880
Take a break from school?

42:13.200 --> 42:14.330
Just for one year.

42:14.360 --> 42:15.640
I'll start a business this year,

42:15.670 --> 42:16.840
and once I make money,

42:16.860 --> 42:18.370
I'll come back next year to continue my studies.

42:18.390 --> 42:19.120
Don't worry.

42:19.150 --> 42:20.840
I'll definitely get my high school diploma.

42:21.170 --> 42:22.230
No, no, no.

42:22.260 --> 42:23.710
You can start a business anytime.

42:23.750 --> 42:24.830
Why does it have to be now?

42:24.850 --> 42:25.890
Mr. Xu,

42:25.930 --> 42:27.200
time waits for no one.

42:27.270 --> 42:28.820
Once you're ready, you have to do it.

42:28.820 --> 42:29.950
And I'm sure I can make it.

42:30.290 --> 42:31.760
You've read my business plan too.

42:31.780 --> 42:32.620
Do you think there are any problems?

42:32.650 --> 42:34.250
I think there's a big problem.

42:34.510 --> 42:36.510
Xie Wanghe, you're now a student.

42:36.580 --> 42:38.830
You should just focus on your studies.

42:38.850 --> 42:40.590
As for everything else... you... you...

42:40.620 --> 42:41.750
What exactly

42:41.790 --> 42:43.230
do you want to do all day long?

42:43.250 --> 42:45.050
Our family's not doing so well right now.

42:45.090 --> 42:46.590
I have to go back and help.

42:49.150 --> 42:50.800
Would your parents agree to that?

42:50.830 --> 42:52.420
My dad doesn't object at the moment.

42:52.450 --> 42:53.340
I object!

42:53.370 --> 42:53.790
You...

42:53.830 --> 42:56.150
Yes, a high school diploma may not be worth much,

42:56.170 --> 42:57.800
but if you don't have it,

42:57.850 --> 42:58.850
when you enter society in the future,

42:58.870 --> 43:00.830
you'll find it hard to get anywhere, boy.

43:00.860 --> 43:02.300
I'll be my own boss in the future.

43:02.320 --> 43:03.320
I won't need any diplomas.
